# Workshop gallery of A Sloth Mod Renew (PUBLICATION.md, "Screenshots"): one story, in one place, staged photographs
# (GALLERY.md: the session is the director and decides everything). Played in the Sanctuaire de Nelim of SanctuaryBacklot:
# the save "Nelims-tribe", the pass "galerie" (wsl-deps.galerie.map). Rewritten 2026-10-15, recomposed 2026-10-20, rewritten
# again 2026-10-23 after run 9f78 (1 green; 2 and 3 failed on the sky glow, 0.49 at 18h and 0.14 at 19h) and a rating of 3 for
# the old plan (three medium shots, an outfit change per scene, no instant, no gesture). Director pass by an Opus sub-agent kept.
#
# THE STORY, "the sloth hour". One summer afternoon in the flower garden. Nelim crosses it with hay, finds the sloth awake,
# sets hay down for it, walks on with it and its young trailing behind her, and leaves them at dusk by a torch lamp. Axis: she walks
# West to East in 1 to 3, and turns back West in 4. Hours: 15h, 15h and a quarter, 17h, 18h. Nelim keeps ONE outfit all day
# (deep blue shirt rgb (32, 64, 128), brown trousers rgb (90, 64, 44), Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony, hair colour from her genes (canon), Body_Heart): no change, the
# afternoon is one afternoon (GALLERY.md, criterion d). No hat. The map is 20 degrees and Clear, so no jacket either.
# Hay: she carries 12 in 1, sets 4 down in 2, and carries the remaining 8 in 3 and 4.
#
# SHOTLIST (write-shotlist, 2026-10-23; estimate 1 to 5 before playing, every scene must reach 4). Framing is a camera zoom
# (root size N: 2N cells tall, 3.56N wide); the Sanctuary floors N at 2 (ticket 3219).
#   1 | 15h   | wide, (153, 107) zoom 3.0   | Nelim mid-stride South, face shown, with 12 hay, just after she spotted it. Forced walk (153,108) to (153,106), 18 ticks, then paused | Mossy kept asleep at (153, 105) (was: awake facing South at (154, 104), daylily (156, 106) | a sloth is small, she noticed it | est 4
#   2 | 15h13 | medium, (155, 106) zoom 2.2 (7.8 x 4.4 cells, bottom edge z 103.8 clears the bed corner, hidden anyway) | Nelim beside the hay she just set down in front of Mossy, hands free, in profile facing East, small smile, gaze toward the sloth; before Mossy eats. Forced haul of 4 hay from (153, 106) to (154, 106), 24 ticks, then paused (if the drop is late the hay is still carried and still reads) | Mossy awake at (154, 105) facing South, head toward the hay (the one front view); Plant_Daylily (156, 104), shared with 1; bed hidden | a kindness, not a leash | est 4.5 (Opus pass 2026-11-06: kept off-centre frame; refused pause-before-drop, her face hid behind the stack in 3; refused 25 hay, the story count is 12, 4, 8; refused Pip, the young one first shows in 3)
#   3 | 17h   | close, (155, 106) zoom 2.0 (4 x 7.1 cells, z 104 to 108, x 151.4 to 158.6: clears the bed corner, hidden anyway) | Nelim just after she set the 8 hay down at (156, 105), hands free, walking East, small smile, the young one still catching up. Forced walk (154,105) to (156,105), follows within 1 cell, 20 ticks, then put down at (156, 105) (she picks 8 up again for 4) | Mossy then Pip (life stage 0) trailing in file in profile; Plant_Daylily (153, 106) behind the sloths, TorchLamp (156, 106) unlit, waiting for 18h (lit in 4); every prop on z = 106 so none hides her | it follows whoever brought the hay | est 4.5 (Opus pass 2026-11-06 on scene 3: kept frame moved off the bed corner, hide step added, hay cell written, two props added on row 106; refused Pip stands-at-least step, not needed yet; unverified: a placed lamp not lit, row 106 free, run 3caf lamp at (156, 106) did not show)
#   4 | 18h   | closing, (154, 106) zoom 2.2 | Nelim half turned, leaving West with 8 hay; just after the baby fell asleep. Pip kept asleep (NPT step), then forced walk (156,105) to (154,105), 8 ticks | Mossy awake, watching, Pip asleep by a lit torch lamp (156, 104), glow asserted 0.4 | they stay, one young at a time, no hurry | est 4
# Faces: 1 her own face (smirk); 2 a small smile; 3 and 4 a small peaceful smile. Wide 3.0, medium 2.4, close 2.0, pull back 2.4:
# variety of shots, an opening image that sets the garden, a closing one that leaves. At 3.0 the sloth is about 25 px in a 268 px
# thumbnail (criterion j): Mossy lies at the bottom edge, near the camera, to be the biggest thing of the shot after Nelim.
# Subtitles (PUBLICATION.md): 1 Nelim crosses the flower garden and notices the sloth. 2 A pile of hay, left within reach.
# 3 It follows the one who brought the hay. 4 A mother, her baby, and no hurry.
# Run 0ddc (2026-10-23, 4 of 4 green) read: 2 and 3 accepted; 1 refused (bed corner bottom right, frame moved to (153, 106), the sloth was
# standing, not asleep: the adult stops a forced LayDown, as in 4); 4 refused (Nelim cut by the top edge: she walked round a rock chunk off row z = 105, so she now
# starts and ends on that row). Mossy is awake in 1, 2 and 4.
# Risks, written once: (a) the gesture steps (forced walk, forced haul, follows, lies down) were never played with a pause
# right after "I let N ticks pass": if the walk does not show, 1 to 3 lose criterion e together; (b) a haul may end before the
# pause, the hay is then on the ground and still reads; (c) only row z = 105, x 152 to 156 is known free, so every path stays
# in that block; (d) the sloth faces the camera in 2 only because it is placed so, the one posed element of the series, on
# purpose (criterion c).
# Run 7ec6 (2026-10-28, 2 of 2 green) read: 1 and 4 refused again, and recomposed 2026-10-29. Bed corner: it sits about x >= 157.4,
# z <= 103.3, so every frame keeps its bottom edge at z >= 103.8 (1: (153, 107) zoom 3.0; 4: (154, 106) zoom 2.2). 1: Nelim now walks
# South toward the camera, her face shows, from (153, 108) to (153, 106), Mossy at (153, 105) in profile, small smile. 4: lamp moved
# to (156, 106) inside the frame, the hay is carried after the 40 ticks wait (she dropped it during the idle wait), all on rows 105 and 106.
# NPT answered 2026-10-29: `the animal "X" is kept asleep` (holds LayDown every frame, adult and baby; compiled, not played; needs the
# ColonistRace DLL of NPT's last commit staged) and `the artificial buildings within N cells of (x, z) are hidden` (logs [hide-buildings]
# with each def and cell). Used: Mossy asleep in 1, Pip asleep in 4 (Mossy awake, watching), the bed hidden at (158, 102) radius 2 in both.
# Run 3caf (2026-11-03, 2 of 2 green) read 2026-11-05: both refused again, recomposed 2026-11-05. 1: the carried hay hid her face walking South, so she now
# walks East in profile on row 105 from (152, 105) to (154, 105) (as in 3, accepted), Mossy kept asleep at (153, 106) below her path. 4: Nelim was cut by the
# right edge and the lamp at (156, 106) was not visible (cause asked of NPT: the vanilla lamps near the bed corner are hidden by the hide step, the placed decor lamp did
# not show): she is now stood at (155, 105) after the wait and walks West to (153, 105), well inside the frame.
# Runs 9e9e and 24b0 (2026-11-06, 4 of 4 green) read: all four refused, the carried hay hid her face and mouth. Recomposed 2026-11-06 with NPT's
# new steps (00edff8, compiled, not played): `"Nelim" puts down what it carries [at (x, z)]` (hands empty, hay stays on the ground) after each walk,
# in 2 at (154, 106) in front of Mossy; and `the animal "Pip" stands at least 3 cells from "Nelim"` in 4 (the baby overlapped her), she now leaves West to (152, 105).
# Real verdicts go next to the estimates in STATUS.md after the run.
#
# THE PLACE. "flower-garden" (SANCTUAIRE-LIEUX.md): the garden of lilies and roses north of the statue field, centre (154, 105).
# The softest, greenest corner that is not a building, with no roof and no furniture. A bed corner sits at about (158, 102):
# frames centred on (154, 105) at zoom 2 or more stay clear of it. Nelim is drawn from her canon (SanctuaryBacklot/docs/NELIM-PROFIL.md):
# a high ponytail (Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony, the canon, played from 2026-11-05), her canon hair colour from her genes, the Body_Heart tattoo. The first "wears" step undresses her, so
# every garment is dressed explicitly. The face is set last, after every wait, because Facial Animation recomputes it at every
# tick (SanctuaryBacklot, run 56b0). Every scenario reloads the save, removes the animals of the save, cleans the filth, sets
# the hour and the weather, places the set, photographs it. Nothing asserts about the image but the sky glow of 4: a person opens
# each one (@review). The information card (Wildness 50 %) and the trader's stock are menus and screens, taken by hand.
#
# Pass "galerie": -DepMap wsl-deps.galerie.map.

